{
  "dom_id": "step-e12751",
  "name": "Example: Identifying Implicit Quantification",
  "problem": "Express the following sentence in formal language.\n\nThe square of a natural number is also a natural number.",
  "worked_solution": "Notice that our sentence can be re-phrased as: \n\n*For any natural number $n,$ we have that $n^2$ is also a natural number.*\n\nNow, \"$n^2$ is also a natural number\" means:\n\n*There exists a natural number $m$ such that $n^2 = m.$*\n\nTherefore, we get the following statement:\n\n*For any natural number $n,$ there exists another natural number $m$ such that $n^2 = m.$*\n\nMore formally, this reads as\n\n$$\n\\forall \\, n \\in \\mathbb{N}, \\, \\exists \\, m \\in \\mathbb{N}, \\, n^2 = m.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12751\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying Implicit Quantification</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12751\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Express the following sentence in formal language.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The square of a natural number is also a natural number.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                          